{"record_type":"obligation_result","obligation_index":4,"status":"items","reason_code":null,"items":[{"text":"我们聊一下标箔的情况。","semantic_type":"behavior","statement_role":"claim","speech_role":"statement","perspective":"source_explicit","polarity":"affirmed","behavior_status":"intent","temporal_frame":"unknown","evidence_selector":"slot"}]}
{"record_type":"obligation_result","obligation_index":5,"status":"items","reason_code":null,"items":[{"text":"首先，标箔跟锂电在后端处理上，标箔会有一些设备需求，也请您帮我们做一个价值量的大致拆分。","semantic_type":"unknown","statement_role":"question","speech_role":"question","perspective":"source_explicit","polarity":"unknown","behavior_status":null,"temporal_frame":"unknown","evidence_selector":"slot"}]}
{"record_type":"obligation_result","obligation_index":6,"status":"items","reason_code":null,"items":[{"text":"标箔的生产设备——生箔机，往前基本和锂电大致一样。","semantic_type":"fact","statement_role":"claim","speech_role":"statement","perspective":"source_explicit","polarity":"affirmed","behavior_status":null,"temporal_frame":"unknown","evidence_selector":"slot"}]}
{"record_type":"obligation_result","obligation_index":7,"status":"no_supported_item","reason_code":"incomplete_fragment","items":[]}
{"record_type":"obligation_result","obligation_index":8,"status":"items","reason_code":null,"items":[{"text":"因为传统标箔的线速度会高一点。","semantic_type":"fact","statement_role":"evidence","speech_role":"statement","perspective":"source_explicit","polarity":"affirmed","behavior_status":null,"temporal_frame":"unknown","evidence_selector":"slot"}]}
{"record_type":"obligation_result","obligation_index":9,"status":"items","reason_code":null,"items":[{"text":"HTE和低阶RTF的高温高延展铜箔，线速度低一些，大概是6台生箔机配套1台表面处理机。","semantic_type":"fact","statement_role":"evidence","speech_role":"statement","perspective":"source_explicit","polarity":"affirmed","behavior_status":null,"temporal_frame":"unknown","evidence_selector":"slot"},{"text":"如果要做高阶的RTF和HVLP的低阶甚至更高阶产品，处理机的数量可能会增加到3到4台生箔机对应1台表面处理机。","semantic_type":"forecast","statement_role":"condition","speech_role":"statement","perspective":"source_explicit","polarity":"unknown","behavior_status":null,"temporal_frame":"unknown","evidence_selector":"slot"}]}
{"record_type":"obligation_result","obligation_index":10,"status":"items","reason_code":null,"items":[{"text":"这样处理机的量就上来了。","semantic_type":"fact","statement_role":"claim","speech_role":"statement","perspective":"source_explicit","polarity":"affirmed","behavior_status":null,"temporal_frame":"unknown","evidence_selector":"slot"}]}
{"record_type":"obligation_result","obligation_index":11,"status":"items","reason_code":null,"items":[{"text":"传统标准HTE的处理机大概600到700万一台，现在HVLP的超过1000万一台，大概就是这个价格。","semantic_type":"fact","statement_role":"claim","speech_role":"statement","perspective":"source_explicit","polarity":"affirmed","behavior_status":null,"temporal_frame":"unknown","evidence_selector":"slot"}]}
{"record_type":"obligation_result","obligation_index":12,"status":"items","reason_code":null,"items":[{"text":"不知道这样讲您能理解吗？","semantic_type":"unknown","statement_role":"question","speech_role":"question","perspective":"source_explicit","polarity":"unknown","behavior_status":null,"temporal_frame":"unknown","evidence_selector":"slot"}]}
{"record_type":"obligation_result","obligation_index":13,"status":"items","reason_code":null,"items":[{"text":"能理解。","semantic_type":"fact","statement_role":"answer","speech_role":"answer","perspective":"source_explicit","polarity":"affirmed","behavior_status":null,"temporal_frame":"unknown","evidence_selector":"slot"}]}
{"record_type":"obligation_result","obligation_index":14,"status":"items","reason_code":null,"items":[{"text":"那我理一下：","semantic_type":"behavior","statement_role":"claim","speech_role":"statement","perspective":"source_explicit","polarity":"affirmed","behavior_status":"intent","temporal_frame":"unknown","evidence_selector":"slot"}]}
{"record_type":"obligation_result","obligation_index":15,"status":"items","reason_code":null,"items":[{"text":"每万吨的产值24套，应该对应4台表处理。","semantic_type":"fact","statement_role":"claim","speech_role":"statement","perspective":"source_explicit","polarity":"affirmed","behavior_status":null,"temporal_frame":"unknown","evidence_selector":"slot"}]}
{"record_type":"obligation_result","obligation_index":16,"status":"items","reason_code":null,"items":[{"text":"如果做HTE，就至少要2400万到2800万每万吨，对吧？","semantic_type":"unknown","statement_role":"question","speech_role":"question","perspective":"source_explicit","polarity":"unknown","behavior_status":null,"temporal_frame":"unknown","evidence_selector":"slot"}]}
{"record_type":"obligation_result","obligation_index":17,"status":"items","reason_code":null,"items":[{"text":"如果做HVLP，听下来是3台生箔机对应1台表处理，那24套就要乘8，1000万的话就是8000万的价值量。","semantic_type":"condition","statement_role":"condition","speech_role":"statement","perspective":"source_explicit","polarity":"affirmed","behavior_status":null,"temporal_frame":"unknown","evidence_selector":"slot"}]}
{"record_type":"obligation_result","obligation_index":18,"status":"items","reason_code":null,"items":[{"text":"对的。","semantic_type":"fact","statement_role":"answer","speech_role":"answer","perspective":"source_explicit","polarity":"affirmed","behavior_status":null,"temporal_frame":"unknown","evidence_selector":"slot"}]}
{"record_type":"obligation_result","obligation_index":19,"status":"items","reason_code":null,"items":[{"text":"OK，那表处理带来的增量很明显，而且有一个用量通胀的逻辑——越往高阶的电子箔走，消耗量越大。","semantic_type":"fact","statement_role":"claim","speech_role":"statement","perspective":"source_explicit","polarity":"affirmed","behavior_status":null,"temporal_frame":"unknown","evidence_selector":"slot"}]}
